<title>JAPAN: Japan to pursue market reforms as planned -- MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan to pursue market reforms as planned -- MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan will pursue financial market reforms as scheduled, a senior Finance Ministry official told Reuters when asked about the latest Tokyo stock plunge.  </p>
<p>&quot;We will pursue securities market reforms as scheduled,&quot; the ministry official said.</p>
<p>&quot;We think we should remain vigilant on stock prices but there has been no change in Japan's fundamentals.&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
